 "name_en": "Invoice Correction Process with Debit Memo (BDQ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Invoice Correction Process with Debit Memo (BDQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item makes it possible to make corrections to errors in pricing or sales tax calculations. If errors are detected, debit memo requests can be created with a correction of the amount to be debited. This is then placed on a billing block for review. The amount to be debited is calculated as the difference between the original amount and the correct amount. This is entered manually into the debit memo request. Once checked, it is released and becomes relevant for billing. The amount then appears in the billing due list. The debit memo can be created manually. Alternatively, the automatic periodic billing process creates a debit memo to be sent to the customer and posts a journal entry.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create debit memo request</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Remove billing block (review debit memo request)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create debit memo</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate debit memo processing in the system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用借项凭证的发票更正流程 (BDQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目可用于更正定价或销售税计算中的错误。如果检测到错误，可以通过更正要借记的金额来创建借项凭证请求。然后将其放置在开票冻结上以供检查。要借记的金额计算为原始金额与正确金额之间的差异。这是手动输入到借项凭证申请中的。检查后，将其审批并与开票相关。然后，该金额将显示在开票到期清单中。可以手动创建借项凭证。或者，自动定期开票流程会创建要发送给客户的借项凭证并过账日记账分录。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建借项凭证请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移除开票冻结（检查借项凭证请求）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建借项凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioaa7408d008d94c59928fb963e08a7dfc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在系统中集成借项凭证处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
